        <headline>High Wind Warning issued September 25 at 12:31PM MDT until September 26 at 6:00AM MDT by NWS Great Falls MT</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...West winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 60 mph expected.

* WHERE...Bears Paw Mountains and Southern Blaine.

* WHEN...From 8 PM this evening to 6 AM MDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Damaging winds will blow down trees and power lines.
Widespread power outages are expected. Travel will be difficult,
especially for high profile vehicles.
</description>
        <instruction>People are urged to secure loose objects that could be blown around
or damaged by the wind.</instruction>
